/P 396 0 R
/E (In cloud computing, we have the concept of Everything as a Service \(XaaS\). This means that if something can be delivered over the internet, it becomes a service in the cloud. In Everything as a Service \(XaaS\), various services and technologies are provided to users by the cloud, including Infrastructure as a Service \(IaaS\), Software as a Service \(SaaS\), and Platform as a Service \(PaaS\), Function as a Service \(FaaS\), as we mentioned before about these types. In addition to these, there are other services such as Network as a Service \(NaaS\), Desktop as a Service \(DaaS\), Database as a Service \(DBaaS\), Communication as a Service \(CaaS\), Healthcare as a Service \(HaaS\), etc.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
>>
